  "bodyHash": "Ff+Xxe9KpKc=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1HpUCC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1770\" height=\"870\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px\"><strong>由Vic's Modern Warfare原創作者打造，Point Blank是一款致力於社群貢獻的槍械模組，旨在創作一款更貼近Minecraft美學的槍械模組。</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\"><strong><em>適用於Minecraft 1.20.1、1.21.1及1.21.11版本！</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;font-size:24px\"><strong>快來看看這些擴充包！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">毀滅戰士包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-doom-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XfaZVxe.png\" alt=\"描述文字\" width=\"242\" height=\"242\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">戰慄時空包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-half-life-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_c9d74444-db0e-4ade-8d54-4da32a28f134.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">GGO包（刀劍神域外傳Gun Gale Online）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-gun-gale-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_54242b54-6f70-4904-bfda-0ca4293dd260.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"215\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Point Blank加長版擴充包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-point-blank-extended-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_e637b9dd-e498-4151-a639-d2f2d08b73e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">天命包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-destiny-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q3iL0A3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">（官方）蔚藍檔案包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-blue-archive-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHrUfDi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"212\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">電馭叛客2077包（社群製作）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/cyberpunk-2077-guns-for-vics-point-blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/996/840/64/64/638513964039333793.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">最後一戰：冬季危機包（社群製作）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vpb-halo-winter-contingency\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1433/208/64/64/638928593681850821.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"138\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在遊戲中管理這些擴充包，或是透過選單頂端的按鈕瀏覽器尋找更多擴充包：</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5yl3RSY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"536\" height=\"302\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Point Blank以符合Minecraft美學的方式加入槍械，同時不失高品質的模型與動畫。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>本模組的主要特色是，即使完全沒有程式編寫知識或經驗，也能快速將自己製作的高品質槍械加入遊戲。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>這是一款只要準備好建模、材質貼圖及動畫的槍械，最快只需10分鐘就能加入遊戲的模組。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>易學易用，輕鬆上手。</strong></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I5TEgBi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"188\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fjbZSU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"323\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cI6rcHk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K3wezC6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設情況下，Point Blank提供約40把（且持續增加中）武器。許多槍械具備射擊模式，你可以按下'B'鍵來切換。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>所有槍械都具備高品質的換彈、檢視及拔槍動畫。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>槍械可能會有射擊誤差。跑步時武器準確度會降低，瞄準時則會提高。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>生存模式：所有武器都可透過武器印表機在生存模式中合成！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m9udtQ7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J79QxYG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>自訂化：武器可透過配件進行自訂！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UW3Tvel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"752\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZSKeLsT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Point Blank的內容創作需要兩項重要工具：Geckolib和Blockbench。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Blockbench是一款第三方軟體，可供你為物件進行建模、材質貼圖及動畫製作。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你還需要在Blockbench中安裝Geckolib插件。詳細資訊請參閱Geckolib說明中的Geckolib維基百科。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>若要開始使用，請參考我們的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-template-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方範例內容擴充包</a></span>。你可以用它來創作自己的內容。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong>影片教學：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ASlc1_bvItE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lDwSw3pE_1k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEa0fKyU2QI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
